    <string name="swipe_log">Record swipes for tuning</string>
    <string name="swipe_log_hint">When on, every swipe that types a word is saved: the finger path and the word you confirmed. The last 1000 swipes are kept, the oldest are dropped as new ones arrive. It stays on the phone only and is never saved in password fields. It is for tuning swipe accuracy; you can export it and it is included in the backup. Off by default.</string>
